message: "If you use this benchmark or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Periospot Dental LLM Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark measuring how well language models answer clinical
  dental questions across periodontics, implants, oral-systemic medicine,
  pharmacology, and patient communication, using clinician-written, guideline-
  verified scoring rubrics.
type: dataset
authors:
